><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taylor-itkin" >taylor_itkin</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2938475&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609274016" alt="Zhange" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2938475)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zhange" >Zhange</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dr-wondertainment-hub">http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dr-wondertainment-hub</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nykacolaquantum" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5187906&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609274016" alt="Nykacolaquantum" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5187906)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nykacolaquantum" >Nykacolaquantum</a></span></p> 
