&lt;strong&gt;Date of Recovery:&lt;/strong&gt; ██-██-20██&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Location of Recovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Salto, Brazil&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Current Status:&lt;/strong&gt; In storage.&lt;br /&gt;
