&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: red&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;A yellow brandless notebook. Every page contains multiple hand drawn rainbows. The words &amp;quot;KYLE, AGE SIX&amp;quot; are visible on the item&#039;s cover. All written text regarding said notebook will alter its colour in order to follow the pattern of the colours of the rainbows contained in the notebook. The drawings do not follow the pattern of real rainbows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
