&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item Description:&lt;/strong&gt; A 2&amp;#160;m. by 1&amp;#160;m. glass oblong that acts as a portable window to a parallel universe. Reverse side is an unidentified opaque material which has resisted all efforts to damage it thus far. Currently, the point of divergence between universes is unknown, but does not appear to have altered any aspect of Earth. Glass is functionally a mirror.&lt;br /&gt;
