It’s clear which soda you’ll love more&lt;br /&gt;
To friendly rivals, THIS MEANS WAR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;float:left; width: 45%; padding: 0 2%&quot;&gt;
