/a> &quot;The Norther' Light Phantom&quot;</li> </ul> </div> <br /> <h1><span style="color: #000;"><span>Tales</span></span></h1> <div style="border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 0px;"> <ul> <li>A small poetry page: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/from-syllables-to-lines-to-imagination">From syllables to lines to imagination</a></li> <li>My gift to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yellowislol" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6284593&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609274024" alt="YellowISlol" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6284593)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yellowislol" >YellowISlol</a></span> for the 2020 art exchange: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/a-josie-holiday">A Josie Holiday</a></li> </ul> </div> <br /> <h1><span style="color: #000;"><span>Miscellaneous</span></span></h1> <div style="border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 0px;"> <ul> <li>I added the heartwarming and tearjerkers lists in the <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/user-curated-lists">User Curated Lists</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <div style="border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 0px;"> <p>I can't say that I have a favourite SCP but I think the ones below deserve more recognition.</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5364">SCP-5364</a> &quot;Seventy Millimeter Projector&quot; by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609274024" alt="PlaguePJP" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" >PlaguePJP</a></span></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5120">SCP-5120</a> &quot;Fidelis Roma&quot; by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vivarium" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6798022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609274024" alt="Vivarium" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6798022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vivarium" >Vivarium</a></span></li> </ul> <p>The best tale I ever had.</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/ambrose-gloucester">Ambrose Gloucester: Best You Ever Had</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/riemann" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1787775&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609274024" alt="Riemann" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1787775)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/riemann" >Riemann</a></span></li> </ul> <p>I will put more works here over time.</p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <h1><span style="color: #000;"><span>To do list</span></span></h1> <div style="border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;"> <ul> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Complete the gift-exchange</span> Art exchange 2020 done.</li> <li>Enter a contest</li> <li>Do a flight to better my critique skills</li> <li>Create or involve myself in a hub</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6438262&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609274024" alt="Sirslash47" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6438262)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47" >Sirslash47</a></span></p> 
